><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">(998) 884 11 04, 887 17 00<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family: verdana\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: blue\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Bridesmaid Flowers.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762718\/width\/295\/height\/301\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included v2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762720\/width\/333\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Flowers Bridal Included.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762722\/width\/335\/height\/480\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <strong>Maya Floral<\/strong> - <a href='http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mayafloral.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: #181818\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Centerpieces with local flowers start at $65.00 usd. The flowers we consider as local flowers because they are very easy to get in Mexico are: Roses, Alstroemerias, Snapdragon, Lisianthus, Asian Lilies, Mums, Gerbera daisy, Chrysantemun and some others. We do not have centerpieces (unless they are cocktail centerpieces) under this price, our average priced centerpieces are $75.00 \/ $80.00 usd, centerpieces that include fine flowers like Orchids, Tulips, etc, start at $85.00 usd\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/\" title=\"\"><strong>Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\">\u00a0<br><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\">Looking for a travel agent that KNOWS DISNEY?<\/a><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">\u00a0 We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 | \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128